---
// VeganVegSection.astro — Zero-Cards Vegan & Vegetarian Editorial Spread (Zero Characters)
---

<section class="vegan-veg-section" id="vegan-vegetarisch">
  <div class="cantina-container">
    <div class="vegan-grid">
      
      <!-- Content Column -->
      <div class="vegan-content">
        <span class="sticker-badge badge-vegan" style="transform:rotate(-2deg)">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 8C8 10 5.9 16.17 3.82 19a1 1 0 0 0 1.26 1.56C6.77 19.62 9.5 18 12 17c-1.44 4-3 5-3 5h3c3-2.5 5-7 4-14z"/></svg>
          100% PLANT &amp; VEGGIE POWER
        </span>
        <h2 class="vegan-title">FÜR VEGETARIER & VEGANER</h2>
        
        <p class="vegan-lead">
          Du möchtest <strong>vegan oder vegetarisch mexikanisch essen in Berlin-Mitte</strong>? Bei Taco Loco findest du eine bunte Vielfalt an ausgewiesenen pflanzlichen und vegetarischen Gerichten.
        </p>

        <div class="vegan-items-list" data-stagger>
          <div class="v-item-row">
            <span class="v-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 3C8.5 3 5.5 5 4 8H20C18.5 5 15.5 3 12 3Z"/><path d="M4 10v3a8 8 0 0 0 16 0v-3H4Z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="v-text">
              <h4>VEGGIE TACOS &amp; BURRITOS</h4>
              <p>Knackiges Grillgemüse mit Zucchini, Paprika, Champignons &amp; schwarzen Bohnen in Kräuter-Tomatensauce.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="v-item-row">
            <span class="v-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="9" ry="7"/><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="v-text">
              <h4>FRISCHE GUACAMOLE &amp; PICO DE GALLO</h4>
              <p>Täglich frisch gestampfte Hass-Avocados mit Limettensaft, Koriander &amp; knusprigen Maistortillas.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="v-item-row">
            <span class="v-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="v-text">
              <h4>VEGGIE ENCHILADAS &amp; QUESADILLAS</h4>
              <p>Herzhaft gefüllt mit Gemüse und Schmelzkäse (auf Wunsch auch ohne Käse 100% vegan zubereitet).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vegan-actions">
          <a href="/vegan-vegetarisch" class="btn-primary">
            <span>VEGGIE & VEGAN SPEISEKARTE →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Food Graphic Column -->
      <div class="vegan-graphic" data-reveal>
        <div class="food-plate-wrap">
          <img 
            src="/images/salad.webp" 
            alt="Frischer mexikanischer Salat bei Taco Loco Berlin" 
            class="vegan-food-img animate-bounce-subtle"
            width="380"
            height="320"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <span class="sticker-badge badge-favorite vegan-tag" style="transform:rotate(3deg)">★ GEMEINSAM ESSEN OHNE KOMPROMISSE</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .vegan-veg-section {
    background-color: var(--bg-canvas);
    padding: 5.5rem 0 6rem;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--brand-green);
  }

  .vegan-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.9fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3.5rem;
  }

  .vegan-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .vegan-title {
    color: var(--brand-green);
    margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.4rem);
  }

  .vegan-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
  }

  .vegan-items-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.6rem;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .v-item-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.2rem;
    border-bottom: var(--border-dashed);
  }

  .v-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--brand-green);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .v-text h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--brand-green);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .v-text p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-ink);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .vegan-actions {
    display: flex;
  }

  /* ── Right Graphic ── */
  .vegan-graphic {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .food-plate-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .vegan-food-img {
    max-height: 320px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: var(--drop-shadow-food);
    transition: transform var(--dur-medium) var(--ease-out);
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .vegan-food-img:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05) rotate(2deg);
    }
  }

  .vegan-tag {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 950px) {
    .vegan-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .vegan-content {
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .v-item-row {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .vegan-veg-section {
      padding: 3.5rem 0;
    }
    .vegan-food-img {
      max-height: 220px;
    }
  }
</style>
